body:
When auto-generating select options in the inline-data fallback, this uses the component state `data` rather than the local `inlineData` (which is the source of truth in this branch). On initial render `data` can still be stale/empty (effects run after paint), causing options/labels to be missing until a later render. Using `inlineData` here avoids that transient mismatch and makes the branch self-contained.
```suggestion
          // Auto-generate select options from inline data when no options defined
          if (resolvedType === 'select' && !fieldMeta.options) {
            const uniqueValues = Array.from(new Set(inlineData.map(row => row[fieldName]).filter(Boolean)));
```
